{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD]\n[00:05.10]Oh, zoom\n[00:12.60]Sippin' on that dirty, I know\n[00:14.96]Sippin' on that dirty, lil' bitch, uh-huh\n[00:16.10]Oh-oh (\n[00:16.26]Wheezy outta here\n[00:16.76])\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:16.86]Sippin' on that dirty on the daily\n[00:18.00]Ballin' out like Tracy McGrady\n[00:19.00]Lil' bitch think that she can play me\n[00:20.70]I'm finessin' hoes on the daily\n[00:23.32]Bad bitch strippin’, making 10K a night\n[00:26.18]I'm up in a different country, 10K on flight\n[00:28.88]Balenciaga's on me, I'll still rob you for your Mike's\n[00:31.66]And if you try to take my money, I'll—\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:33.16]Rob you for your life\n[00:35.94]Uh, uh, uh, uh, for your life\n[00:37.08]Uh, uh, uh, uh, rob you for your life\n[00:41.56]Uh, uh, uh, uh, for your life\n[00:42.76]Uh, uh, I'ma be rich for life\n[00:46.92]Uh, uh, I can take your bitch for life\n[00:48.34]Uh-huh, tatted on me, that's for life\n[00:51.88]Triple nine, triple nine, that's for life, uh-huh\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[00:57.22]Put this shit on the gang, ain't no false shit\n[01:00.04]I don't really got no time for no opp shit\n[01:02.90]Foenem made me run up out of options\n[01:05.80]I'ma put that nigga in a coffin\n[01:08.48]Codeine in my cup, I'm nеver coughing\n[01:11.30]Told her I got powers likе I'm Austin\n[01:14.14]I'ma drop a bomb, Boston\n[01:16.98]I could fuck your mom, I'm awesome\n[01:19.80]Wake up every day, straight flossing\n[01:22.74]VVS my teeth and my rings\n[01:25.44]Run up on me, get hit like a lick\n[01:28.28]I'ma pass that bitch, no assist\n[01:31.08]We can get it poppin' like a zit, zit\n[01:33.88]Run up, that's okay, I'll get it in\n[01:36.74]You can catch me running from the pigs, pigs\n[01:39.52]Free my niggas out of the pen', that's for life\n[01:44.12]That's for life, uh\n[01:46.28]I'ma be high, that's for life, uh-huh\n[01:49.70]'Til I die, stuck for life\n[Verse 3: Future]\n[01:53.10]Diamond in my nose, man, I sneeze high shit